{"id":"6b40e3ecfaa895b6","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-epsilon-0-accessible.md","title":"Epsilon 0 Accessible Proposition","display":"thm-epsilon-0-accessible — Epsilon 0 Accessible Proposition","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-epsilon-0-accessible","aliases":["72-thm-epsilon-0-accessible"],"display":"thm-epsilon-0-accessible — Epsilon 0 Accessible Proposition","depends_on":["[[72-df-accessible-ordinal]]","[[72-lem-epsilon-0-notation]]","[[72-df-epsilon-0-notation]]","[[72-thm-accessibility-well-founded-equivalence]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Local ZFC derivation from CNF order-isomorphism","verification_status":"source-and-argument-reviewed","proof_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_2026_10_22":"把特定CNF记号可及性明确接回一般良基性等价"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-epsilon-0-accessible"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-epsilon-0-accessible</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-epsilon-0-accessible — Epsilon 0 Accessible Proposition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"839f229fc9fb3b6f\" href=\"?note=839f229fc9fb3b6f\" title=\"72-df-accessible-ordinal\">72-df-accessible-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3e21ee2923aace9a\" href=\"?note=3e21ee2923aace9a\" title=\"72-lem-epsilon-0-notation\">72-lem-epsilon-0-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"069c67d72b4fb710\" href=\"?note=069c67d72b4fb710\" title=\"72-df-epsilon-0-notation\">72-df-epsilon-0-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"eb639084525fd226\" href=\"?note=eb639084525fd226\" title=\"72-thm-accessibility-well-founded-equivalence\">72-thm-accessibility-well-founded-equivalence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Local ZFC derivation from CNF order-isomorphism"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-and-argument-reviewed"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_2026_10_22","html":"把特定CNF记号可及性明确接回一般良基性等价"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(D_\\varepsilon,R_\\varepsilon)\">\\((D_\\varepsilon,R_\\varepsilon)\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"069c67d72b4fb710\" href=\"?note=069c67d72b4fb710\" title=\"72-df-epsilon-0-notation\">72-df-epsilon-0-notation</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Acc}_R\">\\(\\mathrm{Acc}_R\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"839f229fc9fb3b6f\" href=\"?note=839f229fc9fb3b6f\" title=\"72-df-accessible-ordinal\">72-df-accessible-ordinal</a> 的最小前驱闭包。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}(D,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}(D,R)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7a118aa517b30e4d\" href=\"?note=7a118aa517b30e4d\" title=\"72-df-transfinite-induction\">72-df-transfinite-induction</a> 的元理论前驱良基性；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"eb639084525fd226\" href=\"?note=eb639084525fd226\" title=\"72-thm-accessibility-well-founded-equivalence\">72-thm-accessibility-well-founded-equivalence</a> 给出同一关系与最小可及闭包的等价。这里的WF不是二阶算术中的对象公式WO。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Acc}_{R_\\varepsilon}=D_\\varepsilon.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Acc}_{R_\\varepsilon}=D_\\varepsilon.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}(D_\\varepsilon,R_\\varepsilon).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{WF}(D_\\varepsilon,R_\\varepsilon).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若可及部分的补非空，由实际良序的最小元原理取最小不可及代码a；其所有前驱可及，故闭包定义使a可及，矛盾。所用实际良序来自上一引理，不把代码可生成性当作良基性证明。ε0不是本代码系统内的元素。</p>\n<p>2026-10-22：CNF序同构先给实际良基性，再由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"eb639084525fd226\" href=\"?note=eb639084525fd226\" title=\"72-thm-accessibility-well-founded-equivalence\">72-thm-accessibility-well-founded-equivalence</a> 得全体代码可及；两个方向的关系与量词已在一般定理中明确。原来的最小不可及代码反证仍是独立的同一论证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-accessible-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"839f229fc9fb3b6f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-accessible-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-epsilon-0-notation","status":"resolved","id":"3e21ee2923aace9a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-epsilon-0-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-epsilon-0-notation","status":"resolved","id":"069c67d72b4fb710","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-epsilon-0-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-accessibility-well-founded-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"eb639084525fd226","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-accessibility-well-founded-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-epsilon-0-notation","status":"resolved","id":"069c67d72b4fb710","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(D_\\varepsilon,R_\\varepsilon)$ 如 [[72-df-epsilon-0-notation]]，$\\mathrm{Acc}_R$ 为 [[72-df-accessible-ordinal]] 的最小前驱闭包。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-accessible-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"839f229fc9fb3b6f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(D_\\varepsilon,R_\\varepsilon)$ 如 [[72-df-epsilon-0-notation]]，$\\mathrm{Acc}_R$ 为 [[72-df-accessible-ordinal]] 的最小前驱闭包。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-transfinite-induction","status":"resolved","id":"7a118aa517b30e4d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WF}(D,R)$ 取 [[72-df-transfinite-induction]] 的元理论前驱良基性；[[72-thm-accessibility-well-founded-equivalence]] 给出同一关系与最小可及闭包的等价。这里的WF不是二阶算术中的对象公式WO。","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-accessibility-well-founded-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"eb639084525fd226","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WF}(D,R)$ 取 [[72-df-transfinite-induction]] 的元理论前驱良基性；[[72-thm-accessibility-well-founded-equivalence]] 给出同一关系与最小可及闭包的等价。这里的WF不是二阶算术中的对象公式WO。","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-accessibility-well-founded-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"eb639084525fd226","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"2026-10-22：CNF序同构先给实际良基性，再由 [[72-thm-accessibility-well-founded-equivalence]] 得全体代码可及；两个方向的关系与量词已在一般定理中明确。原来的最小不可及代码反证仍是独立的同一论证。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"(D_\\varepsilon,R_\\varepsilon)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Acc}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WF}(D,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Acc}_{R_\\varepsilon}=D_\\varepsilon.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WF}(D_\\varepsilon,R_\\varepsilon).","display":true}],"bytes":1852,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-280","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-epsilon-0-accessible|prop-epsilon-